    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No palpitations, chest pain, lightheadedness, or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Still a little heat-intolerant; no fever</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No grittiness, pain, redness, or double vision</td></tr><tr><td>Hematologic</td><td>Negative</td><td>No bleeding or bruising</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

